        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA akamfadhaisha Sisera na magari yake yote, na jeshi lake lote, kwa makali ya upanga, mbele ya Baraka; basi Sisera akashuka katika gari lake, akakimbia kwa miguu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
