              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Baraka akayafuatia magari, na jeshi, hata Haroshethi wa Mataifa; na hilo jeshi lote la Sisera likaanguka kwa makali ya upanga; hakusalia hata mtu mmoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
