              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaeli akatoka kwenda kumlaki Sisera, akamwambia, Karibu Bwana wangu, karibu kwangu; usiogope. Akakaribia kwake hemani, naye akamfunika kwa bushuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amu 5:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamwambia, Tafadhali nipe maji kidogo ninywe; maana nina kiu. Akafungua chupa ya maziwa, akampa kunywa, akamfunika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akamwambia, Simama mlangoni pa hema; kisha itakuwa mtu awaye yote akija na kukuuliza, akisema, Je! Yupo mtu hapa, basi, mjibu, La, hapana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.5.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amu 5:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yaeli, mkewe Heberi, akatwaa kigingi cha hema, akashika nyundo mkononi mwake, akamwendea polepole, akamtia kile kigingi katika kipaji chake, nacho kikapenya, hata kuingia mchangani; kwa maana usingizi mzito ulikuwa umemshika; basi akazimia, akafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na tazama, Baraka alipokuwa akimfuatia Sisera; Yaeli akatoka ili kumlaki, akamwambia, Njoo, nami nitakuonyesha yule mtu unayemtafuta. Basi akamwendea, na tazama, Sisera amelala humo, amekufa, na hicho kigingi kilikuwa kipajini mwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
